# ── Trivision Kinetic Sculpture .gitignore ────────────────────────────────
# This is a code + fabrication-plans + docs repo. The project folder also holds
# ~108 GB of binary media (Blender scenes, scans, renders) that does NOT belong
# in git — GitHub hard-blocks files over 100 MB. Those assets live on disk only;
# back them up separately (external drive / cloud). Blender work is version-saved
# locally as `… vN.blend`.

# ── Heavy / binary media (never commit) ──
*.blend
*.blend[0-9]*
*.mov
*.mp4
*.m4v
*.avi
*.tif
*.tiff
*.psd
*.psb
*.skp
*.glb
*.gltf
*.fbx
*.exr
*.dmg

# ── Pure-media folders (entirely excluded) ──
Blender Files/
Blender Scalata Mockup/
ARTWORK TO PRINT/
Equitable Views Camera Scalata/
INSTAGRAM TIMELAPSE VIDEO/
Blender Scalata Mockup/Sketchup Living Room/

# ── Python environments / caches ──
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# ── macOS / editor cruft ──
.DS_Store
*.log

# ── Secrets ──
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem

# ── Claude Code ──
# Local settings stay private; project skills are documentation and get tracked.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
